{
    "word": "wreckage",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "c7ded2f7-a07a-3779-819f-cefdcf78e774",
                "word": "wreckage",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "8ef0c09a-378f-4df8-a64c-375fda456080",
                        "entry_id": "c7ded2f7-a07a-3779-819f-cefdcf78e774",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "wreckages"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "23e748d3-2846-31d3-8992-630cd2b1c9fd",
                        "entry_id": "c7ded2f7-a07a-3779-819f-cefdcf78e774",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Something wrecked, especially the remains or debris of something which has been severely damaged or destroyed."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "87e4cfe6-f397-40ef-b6b8-399b5298de7a",
                                "sense_id": "23e748d3-2846-31d3-8992-630cd2b1c9fd",
                                "text": "About three or four minutes later still an express freight on the up main line ran into the wreckage at about 35 m.p.h. Its engine also overturned and 15 more wagons were added to the mounting pile of wreckage."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e7c167c9-ca8e-4ddf-a0d2-3496a63914cc",
                                "sense_id": "23e748d3-2846-31d3-8992-630cd2b1c9fd",
                                "text": "Explorers have found the 153-year-old wreckage of the Bay State, one the earlier propeller-driven steamships to ply the waters of the Great Lakes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "21be09e8-678c-4bfb-8f4f-bb4020a0ae05",
                                "sense_id": "23e748d3-2846-31d3-8992-630cd2b1c9fd",
                                "text": "Typically for the 'get-on-with-it' era, the railway and military worked like demons to restore the vital rail link. The crater was rapidly filled in and the earth tamped solid, the wreckage was removed by breakdown trains, new rails and sleepers were rushed forward by willing hands, and US Army bulldozers piled in. By 2020 on the same day, both tracks were open for traffic again where there had been a gaping pit just hours before."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a6a71ae1-263c-46ea-af2f-66e0e0067730",
                                "sense_id": "23e748d3-2846-31d3-8992-630cd2b1c9fd",
                                "text": "More recent attempts to salvage general equilibrium theory from the Sonnenschein-Mantel-Debreu wreckage have met with little success[.]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "54ea3626-8ad6-4b3d-b0e9-763099f5f61f",
                        "source_entry_id": "c7ded2f7-a07a-3779-819f-cefdcf78e774",
                        "source_sense_id": "23e748d3-2846-31d3-8992-630cd2b1c9fd",
                        "source_sense_description": "something wrecked",
                        "target_lang_word": "décombres",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "décombres",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "819c86e2-525b-3f40-a2fb-1499fa9c117e",
                                        "entry_id": "c9b2fe81-6332-3d39-b045-65c351e82887",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Amas de matériaux inutiles qui restent sur le terrain après la démolition d’un bâtiment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29b12453-2254-48c1-b99c-2d7360fdf80c",
                                                "sense_id": "819c86e2-525b-3f40-a2fb-1499fa9c117e",
                                                "text": "[…], et tantôt louvoyant, tantôt escaladant, car le chemin était parsemé d’entassements de décombres, ils arrivèrent non sans peine à la muraille indiquée par le Cornouaillais."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7cd1739-fea7-480c-af1e-462372200f34",
                                                "sense_id": "819c86e2-525b-3f40-a2fb-1499fa9c117e",
                                                "text": "Son enfance s’était écoulée là, dans les ruines grises, parmi les décombres et la poussière d’un passé dont elle ignorait tout."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "372471ac-7ceb-4c7e-a5b3-09c83aaf81eb",
                                                "sense_id": "819c86e2-525b-3f40-a2fb-1499fa9c117e",
                                                "text": "Une affreuse paix régna sur ces décombres que tous avaient abandonnés."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ad320b2-395e-46d6-a0c9-f41bbaf5cfc3",
                                                "sense_id": "819c86e2-525b-3f40-a2fb-1499fa9c117e",
                                                "text": "Les petits chevaux des Cosaques escaladent les amas de décombres, entre des lambeaux de murs placardés d’affiches portant la dernière proclamation de Gœbbels : « Tout Allemand doit défendre sa capitale. Les hordes rouges seront arrêtées. »"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "décombres",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a4dcd702-96a0-3ede-8bc8-bf21e9388518",
                                        "entry_id": "6df0f4d7-0655-3361-bb0b-f97713699166",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Deuxième personne du singulier de l’indicatif présent du verbe décombrer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2174fcc5-4a87-3cbe-990b-8c9e299ca043",
                                        "entry_id": "6df0f4d7-0655-3361-bb0b-f97713699166",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Deuxième personne du singulier du subjonctif présent du verbe décombrer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cb26b270-3efc-4a94-971c-a5f527d4e879",
